# Examples where the input contains only source/config files like HTML, CSS, JS, Python, etc. and no build artifacts, dependencies, or temp files, the output should be empty.

Since the changes only include HTML files (JEE/chemistry/index.html, JEE/maths/index.html) which are source files, no files need to be ignored.

# However, looking at the path structure, this appears to be a web project, so we should consider common web development ignores.

